      "founder_bio": "Mokshith is co-founder and CEO of Sieve. Mokshith used to work on computer-vision problems at Scale AI, NVIDIA, and Ford where he experienced first-hand, the difficulties of building and scaling vision-based analytics systems. Before that, he graduated from UC Berkeley with a B.S. Electrical Engineering and Computer Science. Mokshith found his love for computer-vision on his high school robotics team, where he also met Abhi. Mokshith deeply enjoys orange chicken.",
